<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO maintains Content a hold.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO maintains Content a hold.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Nov 21 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Content	   Services	 70.60  ABN Amro HG</p>
<p>COMMENT: * Long-term temp. employment market structural growth 10-15 pct, * Content well placed for the opening of Dutch construction sector, has set up j-v with SFB (Social Fund of the Construction Sector) to open 15 construction related offices by 1998, * share is fairly valued on peer group comparison.</p>
<p>     Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	 P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996 (actual)	3.15	22.4	1.60</p>
<p>    1997		   3.70	19.1	1.85</p>
<p>    1998		   4.25	16.6	2.10</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
